DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Hä?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Meinste, wenn sich 'n
Bösewicht umdreht, sieht
man dann seine gute Seite?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Perché, voglio dire, anche un cattivo
sembrerebbe buono, mentre mangia
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}}, giusto?{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Ah, sí!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Eso es cuando te cambias de
nombre para que no te pidan dinero
cuando te haces famosa.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿No?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Dici davvero?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}} No perché un nome
così fa senza dubbio pensare
a dei superpoteri speciali.
Più lo ripeto e più me ne convinco:
"{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}, {{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0100}}
fantasma"! Geniale!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}A special move?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} You mean like{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
summoning a cactus or a swarm of
marshmallow bees or something?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Un coup spécial ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Du style invoquer
un cactus ou un essaim d'abeilles en
marshmallow ? Ce genre de coup ?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Una mossa speciale?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Tipo{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} restare
in equilibrio su un filo d'erba o fare
la verticale sulle sabbie mobili?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Özel hareket mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Yani mesela{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
kaktüs çağırmak ya da lokum arısı
sürüsü salmak gibi mi?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Yeah, that's what I'm thinkin'!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Like, some old magic dude who was
an adventurer when he was young!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I loved that stuff when I was a kid.
I used to pester this old neighbor
guy with a billion questions!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Evet, ben de onu düşünüyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hani gençliğinde maceracı olan yaşlı
bir büyücü falan!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Çocukken böyle şeylere bayılırdım.
Yaşlı bir komşuyu milyon tane soruyla
bezdirirdim!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Aaah,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡sí, sí!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Y que cuando la usas,
¡te aparecen unos signos
misteriosos en la frente!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ji, ji, eso me encantaba de pequeña.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Una vez, ¡cogí un rotulador y me
dibujé signos de esos en la frente!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ouais,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} dans l'mille !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Et quand tu t'en
sers, justement, d'étranges marques
apparaissent sur ton visage !
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}J'adorais ces trucs, toute môme !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Une fois, j'ai même dessiné des
signes au marqueur sur mon front !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Oooh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sì, sì!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} E quando la usi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
degli strani segni appaiono
sulla tua fronte!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Eh sì, da piccola amavo queste
storie misteriose.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Avevo anche
pensato a quale simbolo usare!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Vaya, ¿en serio?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Seguro?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Y
no corres ni un poquitito, ni
un gramito de peligro mortal?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} ¡Ay!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Pues es que me pongo a pensarlo,
¡y no se me ocurre nadie a quien
pueda salvar por aquí!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Echt jetzt?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Nicht das geringste
Anzeichen von Lebensgefahr?
{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Hab ich mir fast schon gedacht{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Wahrscheinlich gibt's in dieser
Stadt einfach nie 'ne Gelegenheit,
jemandem das Leben zu retten!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¿Eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}} ¡Oye!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Ya entiendo! ¡Te estás
concentrando a ver si consigues
tener superpoderes tú también!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}¡Ay!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Seguro que en {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} ya
está todo el mundo intentándolo!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡Pero nadie lo ha conseguido aún!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}} Ehi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Anche tu stai cercando
di imparare una mossa speciale?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Oh, no!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sono sicura che tutti quanti
{{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}} lo stanno facendo!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ma fanno finta di niente!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}
